cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Provenant in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Provenant: An AI Bill of Materials (AIBOM) Generator for Model & Dataset Provenance"
abstract: >-
  Provenant walks an ML project, discovers its AI components (models, datasets,
  and binding frameworks), resolves their metadata and licenses, reconstructs
  lineage into a provenance graph, analyzes license and provenance risk, and
  assembles a standards-aligned AI Bill of Materials (CycloneDX ML-BOM / SPDX
  AI-profile compatible) with a human-readable risk report.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Choksi"
    given-names: "Krishita Sanjay"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Krishita17/provenant"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-01-01"
keywords:
  - AIBOM
  - ML-BOM
  - SBOM
  - software supply chain
  - model provenance
  - dataset provenance
  - license compliance
  - CycloneDX
  - SPDX
